leanne_sales: Heads-up: Aurora Systems POC tomorrow. They require streaming SDK + model-initiated synchronous webhook calls (model waits for webhook), strict invoice JSON schema enforcement at the edge, SOC2 + customer-managed KMS, and option for VPC/IP allowlist. Need a tiny SDK snippet and a one-page runbook for the call.

jaro_presales: Peak expected ~70 QPS, avg ~130 tokens/response, tool calls ~1/4 responses, single-shot. Latency SLO p50 <120ms, p95 <300ms.

nina_solutions: For Hosted vs Dedicated: Hosted = predictable per-token but costs scale linearly; Dedicated = committed cluster, better p50 stability. Recommend hybrid: baseline Dedicated + hosted burst. I'll DM rough numbers after noon. :+1:

mika_devrel: Minimal Node pseudo-snippet (conceptual):
```js
// streaming + sync function call (pseudo)
const c = new Redwood({ apiKey: process.env.RW_KEY, routing: 'dedicated' });
const s = c.stream({ model: 'redwood-rtf-1', functions: [INVOICE_FN] });
s.on('data', d => process.stdout.write(d.text));
s.on('function_call', async call => {
  const r = await fetch(call.webhook, { method: 'POST', body: JSON.stringify(call.args) });
  const j = await r.json();
  s.resumeWithFunctionResult(j);
});
```

mika_devrel: Edge validation: require top-level "invoice" object with fields invoice_id (string), total_cents (number), currency (string), line_items array of {desc:string,qty:number,unit_cents:number}. Reject nonconformant outputs and route to verification model/human review.

leo_infra: Security notes: customer-managed KMS supported (onboarding window needed); IP allowlist/VPC -> Private deployment or Dedicated with VPC peering + static egress. SOC2 attestation available, I'll drop PDF into deal folder. For sync webhooks recommend endpoint timeout <2s and client-side circuit-breaker to avoid queueing.

jaro_presales: Thanks — can someone assemble a 1-page runbook + a tiny test harness (mock webhook + schema validator) we can run live?

mika_devrel: I'll push a 1-pager + demo script to presales repo within 3 hours: includes sample config (batching: max_batch_size=6, max_wait_ms=8), cache hints, example function spec, and smoke-test steps.

